{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちは ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH8XW35YG8E12WSMVMXBH49","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH8XX34GGVF2QA59QFMW8KD","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ドラマの撮影にて江口のりこさんから\n差し入れをいただきました!\nありがとうございます!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"江口のりこさんは素人の私達に本当に優しく接してくださいます!身長が高く脚がスーッと長くてかっこ良くて憧れの女優さんです!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これ「ハッピーターン」なんだけど\n何だかすごくお洒落!!!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私はストロベリー味を食べたんだけど\n本物の苺を食べているみたいで\n甘酸っぱくて美味しかった!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他にも抹茶ラテとかキャラメルとかバニラミルクとか和三盆とか別の味もいろいろあったから食べてみたいなぁ\\( ˆoˆ )/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"------ ✂︎ｷﾘﾄﾘｾﾝ ✂︎------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH8XY1T4P141S7EM1SXG9RD","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まなってぃまなってぃはサバサバしてそうに見えて実はワガママで甘えん坊で心配性なのだ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH8XZ15SXR0A92J5XVPJQTM","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私とは違って中身が意外と女の子なのだ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はここまで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ばいばい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なな"}],"source":"archive"}